  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Breaking:\n- Upgraded to ModelContextProtocol.AspNetCore 2.0.0-preview.1. Consumers must not reference a different ModelContextProtocol.* version (a mismatch causes a MissingMethodException at startup).\n- IMcpHttpInvoker methods now return Task<CallToolResult> instead of Task<string>. Failed (non-2xx) API calls are surfaced as isError:true instead of a soft error payload.\n\nAdded:\n- Tool and parameter descriptions are pulled from XML <summary>/<param> docs (requires GenerateDocumentationFile).\n- The request CancellationToken is propagated through generated tools to the API call.\n- Method-level [Route] attributes are supported.\n- URL-segment API versioning: the version from [ApiVersion] is baked into the generated route.\n\nFixed:\n- generator.json is no longer created in transitive consumers (e.g. test projects).",
